    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After the Refinement Path Convention, Ye Fan cultivates in the painting world with rank five hero Gu, rank three vagrant warrior Gu, matching killer moves, and cultivation methods. Fang Di Chang notes that Ye Fan’s hero Gu can transform into a hero, that transformed scholar and hero Gu gain a common man’s wisdom with dispositions that differ by type, and that in human form they can use other Gu with proficiency from their cultivator.",
